          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Dear Young Scientists,"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.703,
            0.888,
            0.762
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Welcome back! On the first page of each chapter, you will find a set of questions. These are not meant for any exam—they are unique invitations to spark your curiosity to explore the world of science!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.764,
            0.565,
            0.785
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Why is one side of a puri thinner than the other?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.787,
            0.887,
            0.827
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Are there more grains of sand on all the beaches and deserts of the world, or more stars in our galaxy?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.829,
            0.888,
            0.887
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Right from Grade 6, we’ve observed the incredible diversity of plants and animals around us. From the different shapes of leaves to the many kinds of insects—why has nature created such a vast variety?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.088,
            0.89,
            0.651,
            0.927
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Is there such a question that makes you curious about the world?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.089,
            0.929,
            0.539,
            0.95
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Write it here!"
